        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-02T13:18:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe try it somewhere that isn't Rook City - that is, after all, probably the worst possible environment in terms of difficulty ;). Somewhere like the Freedom Tower, for example, against that version of Gloomweaver would probably be pretty good as it has no targets for him to attack on his flip side (though the Entry Points probably wouldn't be much fun). We've fought Skinwalker Gloomy a few times (I think three or four in total) and while it's come close I dont think we've managed to lose against him yet. I've always enjoyed the games we've had against him because I find them challenging in a fun way. Last time we fought him, in fact, he did absolutely zero damage on his flip side (it took a while to get him there, though) thanks to Tachyon playing Hypersonic Assault on the two or three rounds it took to kill him. I think we did about 92 damage to him in just two rounds, it was cool :D.</p>",
