        "created_at": "2015-03-03T11:05:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've never done anything thematic, no. I just roll dice to determine the villain and environment and then we pick our heroes...though occasionally we'll roll for those as well (sometimes rerolling if we don't fancy playing that particular hero at the time ;). At the London meets everything gets randomised but there are a lot more hero decks as there's all the Cauldron stuff and other bits and pieces as well. But I always try to have a game as the Adept (my favourite) so if he hasn't come up by the time our last game comes along (he usually hasn't) then I'll specifically ask to play him :D.</p>",
