        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-03T15:18:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've done thematic games occasionally, but mostly I go for random. &nbsp;I did just get the Dark Watch promos recently from a friend who had a spare set, so I was able to try out Skinwalker vs. the Dark Watch (albeit in the Tomb of Anubis rather than Rook City). &nbsp;I was playing that with one other friend (each of us playing two characters) and just before Gloomweaver flipped I said \"Sorry, but I really have to do this.\" and put Nightmist into Mistform. &nbsp;A few rounds later all the rest of them were incapacitated but Nightmist had enough options in her hand to finish out the game for a win.</p><p>Now I want to try it in Rook City because that does sound entertaining, even in a loss.</p>",
